v 3
d 'PKGTRANSFER': Module to capture all currently installed packages via .do or .zip
d
d Writes a reinstall script or an offline bundle from the packages tracked
d in PLUS, and restores their source URLs.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d KW: Stata
d KW: pkg
d KW: ssc
d KW: ado
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261013
d
d First version: 24 Mar 2024
d License: MIT
d
d Author: Timothy P Copeland, Karolinska Institutet
d
f pkgtransfer.ado
f pkgtransfer.sthlp
d
